<title>UK: Bradford wool market finds business patchy.</title>
<headline>Bradford wool market finds business patchy.</headline>
<dateline>BRADFORD 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Local business was noted as patchy, with topmakers quotations left completely unchanged from Monday's sale.</p>
<p>However, trading in the carpet and scoured wool sector was good and orders have been placed well forward. Noils are in strong demand, with talk that China has been a buyer.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8074</p>
